  "notes": "{羨|うらや}む means to envy or feel jealous of what others have.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{羨|うらや}む (to envy X)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{羨|うらや}む: to envy someone\n- ⟦{才能|さいのう}→才能：02772_sainou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{羨|うらや}む: to envy talent\n- ⟦{成功|せいこう}→成功：02638_seikou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{羨|うらや}む: to envy success\n- {羨|うらや}んで⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧⟦{仕方|しかた}→仕方：01603_shikata⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦ない→ない：01118_nai⟧: it's no use being envious\n\nFORMS:\n- ⟦{羨|うらや}ましい→羨ましい：02336_urayamashii⟧: envious, enviable (i-adjective)\n- ⟦{羨望|せんぼう}→羨望：05751_senbou⟧: envy, admiration (literary noun)\n\nUSAGE:\n{羨|うらや}む and ⟦{羨|うらや}ましい→羨ましい：02336_urayamashii⟧ express wanting what others have without hostility. For stronger jealousy with resentment, use ⟦{嫉妬|しっと}する→嫉妬する：20164_shittosuru⟧ or ⟦{妬|ねた}む→嫉む：10880_netamu⟧.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {羨|うらや}む: to envy (neutral/positive)\n- ⟦{妬|ねた}む→嫉む：10880_netamu⟧: to be jealous (with resentment)\n- ⟦{嫉妬|しっと}する→嫉妬する：20164_shittosuru⟧: to be jealous (strong emotion)",
